    response: "To download and install this app on your Android device or export the complete project, follow these steps in Google AI Studio:\n\n---\n\n### **Option 1: Download the Android APK (Direct Install)**\n1. In the upper-right corner of the AI Studio window, click the **Settings / Menu** icon (gear or three dots).\n2. Select **Export / Build APK** (or **Generate APK**).\n3. Once generated, download the `.apk` file to your computer or phone.\n4. Transfer the file to your Android phone (or download directly on your phone\'s browser) and tap to install it. *(If prompted, allow \"Install unknown apps\" in your device security settings).*\n\n---\n\n### **Option 2: Download the Full Project Source Code (ZIP)**\n1. Click the **Export** or **Download Project** button in the AI Studio header.\n2. Select **Download ZIP**.\n3. Extract the ZIP file and open the project in **Android Studio** to build, customize, or deploy directly to any connected device.\n\n---\n\n### **Option 3: Push to GitHub**\n1. Click the **GitHub** button in the AI Studio interface.\n2. Link your repository to push the entire codebase directly to your GitHub account."
