  planner_response {
    response: "The reason you got that error is because the standard `gradlew.bat` script was missing from the extracted folder, or your computer doesn\'t have the standalone Gradle CLI installed.\n\nHere is the easiest and most reliable way to get your APK on Windows:\n\n---\n\n### **Option 1: Using Android Studio (Fastest & Guaranteed to Work)**\n\nSince you have Windows, **Android Studio** has the built-in Android SDK and Java compilers:\n\n1. Download and open **[Android Studio](https://developer.android.com/studio)** (it is completely free).\n2. Click **Open** (or **File > Open**).\n3. Browse and select your folder: `C:\\Users\\abhis\\Downloads\\private-messenger`\n4. Wait for it to open (it will automatically download and set up all Android build tools).\n5. In the top toolbar, click:\n   **Build** \342\236\224 **Build Bundle(s) / APK(s)** \342\236\224 **Build APK(s)**\n6. In a minute, a pop-up appears in the bottom right: click **locate** to get your **`app-debug.apk`**!\n\n---\n\n### **Option 2: Direct Build via AI Studio (No Setup Required)**\n\nYou can also download the pre-compiled APK directly from this web page without needing any tools on your computer:\n\n1. Click on the **3 dots / Settings** menu in the top-right header of Google AI Studio.\n2. Select **Build / Download APK**.\n3. Once completed, your browser will download the finished `.apk` file directly to your computer. Transfer it to your phone and install!"
    modified_response: "The reason you got that error is because the standard `gradlew.bat` script was missing from the extracted folder, or your computer doesn\'t have the standalone Gradle CLI installed.\n\nHere is the easiest and most reliable way to get your APK on Windows:\n\n---\n\n### **Option 1: Using Android Studio (Fastest & Guaranteed to Work)**\n\nSince you have Windows, **Android Studio** has the built-in Android SDK and Java compilers:\n\n1. Download and open **[Android Studio](https://developer.android.com/studio)** (it is completely free).\n2. Click **Open** (or **File > Open**).\n3. Browse and select your folder: `C:\\Users\\abhis\\Downloads\\private-messenger`\n4. Wait for it to open (it will automatically download and set up all Android build tools).\n5. In the top toolbar, click:\n   **Build** \342\236\224 **Build Bundle(s) / APK(s)** \342\236\224 **Build APK(s)**\n6. In a minute, a pop-up appears in the bottom right: click **locate** to get your **`app-debug.apk`**!\n\n---\n\n### **Option 2: Direct Build via AI Studio (No Setup Required)**\n\nYou can also download the pre-compiled APK directly from this web page without needing any tools on your computer:\n\n1. Click on the **3 dots / Settings** menu in the top-right header of Google AI Studio.\n2. Select **Build / Download APK**.\n3. Once completed, your browser will download the finished `.apk` file directly to your computer. Transfer it to your phone and install!"
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
